    "title": "",
    "legend": "Medullobastoma WNT &ndash; Activated &ndash; A. Axial T2 image and B. Axial FLAIR image. The lesion is iso to mildly hyperintense on T2 and hyperintense on FLAIR images. It is in close proximity to the dorsal brain stem. Margins are lobulated. Cystic areas are seen in the lesion, which are hyperintense on T2 images (green arrows). The cysts with clear fluid are hypointense on FLAIR images on T2 images. One of the cysts, (blue arrow) is hyperintense on FLAIR, suggestive of proteinaceous fluid.",
